# MedSync Health, Inc.
## Data Processing Agreement Summary
**Document ID**: LEG-004
**Classification**: External
**Version**: 2.5
**Effective**: January 2025

---

## Overview

This Data Processing Agreement ("DPA") governs MedSync's processing of personal data on behalf of customers subject to GDPR, UK GDPR, and other applicable privacy laws.

---

## Definitions

| Term | Definition |
|------|------------|
| Controller | Customer determining purposes of processing |
| Processor | MedSync processing on behalf of Controller |
| Personal Data | Information relating to identified/identifiable person |
| Processing | Any operation performed on personal data |
| Data Subject | Individual whose data is processed |
| Subprocessor | Third party engaged by Processor |

