## Subprocessors

### General Authorization

Customer grants general authorization for MedSync to engage subprocessors, subject to:
- Written agreement with equivalent terms
- Notification of changes
- Objection right

### Notification Process

| Step | Timeline |
|------|----------|
| Notice of new subprocessor | 30 days before engagement |
| Customer objection | 14 days after notice |
| Resolution | Good faith discussion |
| If unresolved | Termination right (affected data) |

