## Data Breach Notification

### Notification Timeline

| Event | Timeline |
|-------|----------|
| Discovery | Day 0 |
| Initial assessment | 24 hours |
| Controller notification | Without undue delay (48 hours) |
| Detailed report | 72 hours |
| Final report | After investigation |

### Notification Content

MedSync will provide:
- Nature of the breach
- Categories of data affected
- Approximate number of records
- Name of contact point
- Likely consequences
- Measures taken/proposed

### Cooperation

MedSync will:
- Investigate promptly
- Take remedial measures
- Preserve evidence
- Cooperate with controller
- Support regulatory notifications

