## Audits

### Audit Rights

| Type | Frequency | Notice |
|------|-----------|--------|
| SOC 2/HITRUST Review | Anytime | None |
| Document Review | Annual | 30 days |
| On-site Audit | Annual | 30 days |
| Regulatory Audit | As required | Reasonable |

### Audit Scope

| In Scope | Out of Scope |
|----------|--------------|
| Processing of Controller data | Other customers' data |
| Security controls | Trade secrets |
| Subprocessor oversight | Proprietary algorithms |
| Compliance evidence | Financial records |

### Audit Process

| Step | Description |
|------|-------------|
| 1 | Written request with scope |
| 2 | Schedule coordination |
| 3 | NDA if required |
| 4 | Audit conducted |
| 5 | Report provided |
| 6 | Findings addressed |

### Costs

| Audit Type | Cost |
|------------|------|
| SOC 2/HITRUST review | No charge |
| Document review | No charge |
| On-site audit | Customer bears external costs |
| Regulatory audit | No charge |

